            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_font": "heading",
            "text": "<p>Foam adhesive tape is reinforced with numerous foam materials and is available in various sizes, backings, thicknesses, and adhesive options to meet your particular application requirements. They are commonly used for sealing, cushioning, insulation, gasketing, and sound-dampening purposes.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "button_label": "",
